              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Wagons are fielded in groups of at least five models, which may not take leaders ,standards or musicians. Each wagon is treated as a single model. Wagon Tabor.</characteristic>
